1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Find the B in Find Tuning, Refining a Junket, Find Tuning the Shire.

2
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:40,000
In the file, Refining a Junket, or in the 2D or 3D window that you drag and drop it into,

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
in the 2D tool bar, select Adjust Boarding Tools.

4
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Empty Select Boarding Tools.

5
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
In the property editor, reduce the particle diameter of the board to 10.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Press the Return key to confirm.

7
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Activate Simulation.

8
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Turn off Simulation after Simulation is completed.

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Adjust the Junket to make it fit the model.

10
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Use the Position Tool to tilt the board forward.

11
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,000
If you tilt all the boards forward,

12
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,000
the Shire may hang on the arm of the virtual model,

13
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,000
instead of wrapped around the virtual model.

14
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,000
To avoid this situation,

15
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:29,000
just select the Junket and use the Position Tool to tilt the board forward.

16
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:34,000
In the 3D window, turn the view to the left view or the right view.

17
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,000
If you want to change it to the left view, press 6.

18
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,000
If you want to change it to the right view, press 4.

19
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Use the Position Tool to adjust the board.

20
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Tilt the board forward a little.

21
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Be careful not to move the Junket away from the model.

22
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Activate Simulation.

23
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Turn off Simulation after Simulation is completed.

24
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:00,000
To fine-tune some details of the Junket,

25
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,000
select the Move Tool in the 3D tool bar.

26
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Gently pull the costume in the form of a simulation.

27
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Adjust it to make the costume fit the model.

28
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Turn the wantingSide of the mold inside out.

29
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:37,000
Put the Junket back to its original position.

30
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Use the Plot Tool to fix the Junket.

31
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Click the register button to save the 24 hours.

32
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Press the left Relax button to move the Junket.

33
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,000
Then pull the Junket.

34
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,000
You just have arrived to the W Angle.

35
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,000
Continue.

